@startuml sample_sign_in_reset_seq
title UC-sign-in - Reset a password (Analysis Sequence)
' palette: boundary=blue · service=green · domain=amber · repo/port=lavender · infra=gray
' Step IDs are hand-placed: phase.step, e.g. 1.3. Reference in prose as sign-in 1.3

actor "Member" as U
participant "«boundary»\nResetRequestForm" as FORM #E6F0FB
participant "«service»\nPasswordResetService" as RESET #E7F4EA
participant "«repository»\nMemberRepository" as REPO #EEE7F7
participant "«value object»\nResetLink" as LINK #FBF2D9
participant "«port»\nMailer" as MAILER #EEE7F7

== Phase 1 - Ask for a reset ==
U    -> FORM  : 1.1 enter email, ask for a reset
FORM -> RESET : 1.2 requestReset(email)
RESET -> REPO : 1.3 getByEmail(email)
alt member found
  REPO --> RESET : Member
  RESET -> LINK : 1.4 issue()
  LINK --> RESET : ResetLink
else no such member
  REPO --> RESET : none
end

== Phase 2 - Send the link ==
RESET -> MAILER : 2.1 send(email, link)
MAILER --> U : 2.2 reset link received
@enduml
